      <div type="layout" source="#source-607-715" rend="page-horizontal-center source-blank-lines-before(2) source-blank-lines-after(2)">
        <div type="layout" source="#source-646-715" style="padding-inline-start: 5em">
          <p source="#source-667-715"><seg source="#source-667-715">この書を外国に在る人々に呈す</seg></p>
